flowchart TD
    Mgmt[Management Account] -->|Consolidated Billing| Sub1[Dev Account]
    Mgmt -->|Consolidated Billing| Sub2[Prod Account]
    Sub1 --> EC2[EC2 Instances]
    Sub2 --> RDS[RDS Databases]
    
    EC2 -.->|Generates Cost Data| CUR[Cost & Usage Report]
    RDS -.->|Generates Cost Data| CUR
    CUR --> S3[(S3 Data Lake)]
    S3 --> Glue[AWS Glue Data Catalog]
    Glue --> Athena[Amazon Athena]
    Athena --> QS[Amazon QuickSight Dashboards]
